plugin-hostd (0.20.5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * ci: the jackd job reads the released channel alone
  * packaging: 0.20.5 floors to omx-clap-core 0.32.3
  * release: 0.20.5
  * packaging: the plugin-hostd-protocol floor is 0.5.7
  * pins.h: the digest length from plugin_db_constants.h; plugin-db >= 0.4.1
  * tests: the fuzz harnesses and their sources build with no OpenSSL header
  * verbs: quit is the token quit, not a token whose first word is quit
  * fuzz: check_verb_call leaves a message with a quote out, as the round
    trip does
  * fuzz: fuzz_reply checks the relay holds each worker it is handed, and
    reads its eof from recv's own answer
  * fuzz: fuzz_command checks each verb's call itself, and reads quit from
    the message's own words
  * clients: the fixtures read a plan's cores as the daemon writes them
  * packaging: plugin-hostd-protocol >= 0.5.7, the table that types the
    replies
  * clients: replies and feedback lines read by the table, no layout of their
    own (#17, #19)
  * tests: the owner's client reads every typed reply and feedback line the
    daemon writes (#17, #19)
  * clients: fixtures for the replies and feedback lines read from the table
    (plugin-hostd-protocol#17, #19)
  * bench: a matrix run read by period length and rate, with each rate's safe
    minimum (#48)
  * bench: tests of a matrix report by period length and rate (#48)
  * sabotage: a gate sums what each shard of the matrix reports
  * sabotage: SABOTAGE_SHARD=i/n keeps every n-th arm by its table position
  * tests: describe --pages, grouped and several hundred parameters with no
    groups
  * describe: --pages, the pages a host lists a plugin's controls in
  * docs: describe --pages, the pages a host lists a plugin's controls in

